{
  "source_sha256": "6539d461157492a6e729e683ccd0f4abed8e7a5e05d52c9d5202591f8811fc42",
  "source": {
    "title": "晉書卷八",
    "revision": "82291520954e5af1fdade894971a2f5810fd4e31",
    "fixed_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR2a0015/82291520954e5af1fdade894971a2f5810fd4e31/KR2a0015_008.txt",
    "file": "raw/KR2a0015_008.txt",
    "sha256": "6539d461157492a6e729e683ccd0f4abed8e7a5e05d52c9d5202591f8811fc42",
    "image_verified": false
  },
  "units": [
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line71",
      "raw_line": 71,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "五年春正月辛巳朔大赦庚寅地震石季龍僭即皇帝",
      "text_sha256": "658c61a96b4750ab0c6f52349a81705c99ef51ca755c58922f09ed35775314fc"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line73",
      "raw_line": 73,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "位於鄴二月征北大將軍褚裒使部將王龕北伐獲石",
      "text_sha256": "75eb2c4aee9a25e670db3ca51d967581b5c6c4fa2db00ccd746d610336d1c62a"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line74",
      "raw_line": 74,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "季龍將支重夏四月益州刺史周撫龍驤將軍朱燾擊",
      "text_sha256": "44395236c7b2cf863d6e4cc671a2824002f010ed72ca529cc4cba8883debf71c"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line75",
      "raw_line": 75,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "范賁獲之益州平封周撫為建城公假慕容雋大將軍",
      "text_sha256": "c9c5ade19110d7b028cbae53d536ef33aa45a88eb81587a93f5e9cfb29756d1f"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line76",
      "raw_line": 76,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "幽平二州牧大單于燕王征西大將軍桓温遣督軍滕",
      "text_sha256": "fe4a082b23fdc3dc4a11d229018854aaf3a894b61304f8eab49cee599c384e1e"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line77",
      "raw_line": 77,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "畯討范文為文所敗石季龍死子世嗣偽位五月石遵",
      "text_sha256": "cec358780d4da6afe3ffeb553ce590a355134038a87b031a9c1542fa9b0da516"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line78",
      "raw_line": 78,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "廢世而自立六月桓温屯安陸遣諸將討河北石遵揚",
      "text_sha256": "dfe4d751e0c4522c795e810bc40b796292a6fb84eea69e32866e9fd4203e18e1"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line79",
      "raw_line": 79,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "州刺史王浹以夀陽来降秋七月褚裒進次彭城遣部",
      "text_sha256": "943a301f3589e2fa145e90f6060b462f214f26f6353a371d9bfc74be4baa810a"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line81",
      "raw_line": 81,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "將王龕李邁及石遵將李農戰于代陂王師敗績王龕",
      "text_sha256": "6e6b756316a6845892141af5e75532ead4de45d138723950a3fa4f9604460360"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line82",
      "raw_line": 82,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "為農所執李邁死之八月褚裒退屯廣陵西中郎將陳",
      "text_sha256": "ece2b6074b4bb5f636b77ad8c41c759b8a1a2843c94a1a996f34b7de13949fb0"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line83",
      "raw_line": 83,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "逵焚夀春而遁梁州刺史司馬勲攻石遵長城戍仇池",
      "text_sha256": "5f22a19e04d7577269d118d6c7f8955c8dd8bba9cecd09d6bea92a370bf78686"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line84",
      "raw_line": 84,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "公楊初襲西城皆破之冬十月石遵將石遇攻宛陷之",
      "text_sha256": "08531d52ea8d9ea983488edff06964ec74605f4e114abe644066a7f441a3698f"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line85",
      "raw_line": 85,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "執南陽太守郭啓司馬勲進次懸鉤石季龍故將麻秋",
      "text_sha256": "a070210e703998001e8a0a983b5ea89618117d0db6ff067883575d708d5d83a3"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line86",
      "raw_line": 86,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "距之勲退還梁州十一月景辰石鑒弑石遵而自立十",
      "text_sha256": "26977893f320cba68a7555216c59a2a0d8abda7b1f1e37829367b799ee43a42f"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line87",
      "raw_line": 87,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "二月己酉使持節都督徐兗二州諸軍事徐州刺史征",
      "text_sha256": "3a49b5b13ebcc878db61785b17feb8204228db2eafd532377fbef80041b3e07b"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line88",
      "raw_line": 88,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "北大將軍開府儀同三司都鄉侯褚裒卒以建武將軍",
      "text_sha256": "4cecd2137ba38f2067f4a85f02c7ca96509ac25064e14f266df3303facf3c338"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line89",
      "raw_line": 89,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 21,
      "text": "吴國内史荀羡為使持節監徐兗二州諸軍事北中郎",
      "text_sha256": "62e97934ad29af10f84e8af2a1157dfad0d3423cdfbf755a3068ccf4aa50ed4b"
    },
    {
      "candidate_paragraph_id": "jin008-yonghe5:line91",
      "raw_line": 91,
      "raw_start": 0,
      "raw_end": 5,
      "text": "將徐州刺史",
      "text_sha256": "14772cd636eb3a6ac13b427b397ef9344f7680405369981b8f08e71b6f5a3960"
    }
  ],
  "projection_rule": "008依原行順序連接非頁碼文字；077原字不變，文本若起::全形空格則刪四個排版碼位。"
}
